        <mxCell id="note" value="Also removed, not pictured (no visual box to show, since these were never rendered as their own field row):&#10;- VACANCY.pendingCvCandidates relation field (reverse side of Candidate.pendingCvVacancyId)&#10;- Edge: VACANCY --pending target--&gt; CANDIDATE (Vacancy o|--o{ Candidate)&#10;- Edge: USER --writes--&gt; CANDIDATE_REVIEW_NOTE (User o|--o{ CandidateReviewNote)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
